    "turns": [
      {
        "question": "What are the different components of an SAP system?",
        "answer": "The components includes in SAP system is application layer, presentation layer and database layer where the application layer provides the interaction between user and UI and the presentation layer where the user interacts. The application layer provides the application where the user will interact with the SAP GUI, where the presentation layer provides the SAP GUI to the user, where the database layer stores the information or helps the user to retrieve and store the data on the databases. These are the three major components.",
        "bridge": "Good. Let's move on.",
