          "provider": "offline"
        },
        "model_answer": "Sure, I\u2019d say my greatest strength is staying calm under pressure while making sure everyone\u2019s in the loop early on. For example, last year our e\u2011commerce platform went down during a Black\u2011Friday flash sale \u2013 traffic spiked to 3\u202f\u00d7\u202fnormal and the checkout was freezing. I immediately called a quick huddle, laid out the timeline, assigned roles, and kept senior leadership updated every 15\u202fminutes. The team isolated the bottleneck and got the site back up in under two hours, limiting revenue loss to under $200\u202fK instead of the projected $1\u202fM. The key thing here is that staying level\u2011headed helped me think clearly, and communicating early kept the team aligned and the stakeholders reassured. That combination has helped me deliver consistently, even in high\u2011stakes situations.",
